WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.891
Identify problems caused by harmful uses of land and water.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.618
Land and water support life and livelihoods. Dumping rubbish can block gutters and

00:00:09.618 --> 00:00:10.375
pollute streams.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.126
Poorly managed mining, careless burning, sand winning or quarrying can damage land

00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:21.462
and water. We should observe environmental problems from a safe distance and report

00:00:21.462 --> 00:00:23.104
hazards to responsible adults.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:28.897
Look at pictures of clean and polluted places; compare the effects on people, animals

00:00:28.897 --> 00:00:29.603
and plants.
